  "description": "\"I'm asking what I was like in bed.\"\n\nA contract marriage entered into out of sheer necessity.\n\nJust as she was barely managing to adapt to this life,\nher husband suddenly came down with amnesia.\n\n“Even if I’ve lost my memories, they say we were a passionately in-love couple, so let’s fulfill our marital duties once.”  \n“.....”   \n“Who knows? If I devotedly serve you, Yu Da-hee, my memory might just return.”\n\nTh...that couldn't possibly be true!   \nIn the first place, not only have we never slept together, we've never even held hands properly!!   \n\nAnd yet... she thought that maybe, just maybe, this could be a golden opportunity.  \nIt was a relationship that started with a contract having a definite end date, but Da-hee wanted to turn this marriage into the real deal.   \nThere's no way she'd let such a sweet contract marriage get annulled!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285003090)  \nR15: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285003091)",
